1
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,510
宝贝儿 找我什么事
Honeydew! What's up?

2
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:08,600
猜猜谁来了
Guess who's here.

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,900
是你爸
Your dad!

4
00:00:10,244 --> 00:00:14,460
他从可可海滩一路开着房车过来的
He drove his R.V. all the way up from Cocoa Beach.

5
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,080
儿子啊 在努力工作吗
Hey, Son, working hard?

6
00:00:16,181 --> 00:00:18,229
他会说 工作个屁
He's gonna say "Hardly working."

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,260
我原本是打算告诉你他出发的事
I meant to tell you he was driving out.

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,960
-他说了吗 -说了
- Did he say it? - Oh, yeah.

9
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,020
好孩子
Good kid.

10
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:27,000
他本该过几天才到的
He wasn't supposed to show up for a few more days.

11
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,360
猜猜他给我们带了什么来
Well, guess what he brought us.

12
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,800
一只狗 给我们养的
A dog... to keep.

13
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,480
没错 没错
Yes! Yes.

14
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:37,080
没错 我早该把狗的事告诉克莱尔
Yes, I should have told Claire about the dog,

15
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,500
我本来准备说的
and I was going to.

16
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:41,020
我只是想等她心情好时再说
But I was just waiting for her to be in the right mood.

17
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,500
其实 几天前的某晚她心情就挺好
Actually, I did get one right mood a couple nights ago,

18
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:48,620
可我用那晚"干"了其他的事
but I cashed that in for something else.

19
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:53,500
-我是不是有大麻烦了 -非常非常大
- Am I in trouble? - Oh, really, really big.

20
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,740
你吓到我了 到底有多糟
Okay, I'm a little scared. How bad is this?

21
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:59,440
我们家立了新规矩 不许进卧室
Oh, well we have a new rule- no sleeping in the bedroom.

22
00:01:04,907 --> 00:01:08,375
普里契特先生 我是本 本·杜根
Mr. Pritchett. Uh, Ben- Ben Dugan.

23
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,440
我是米奇的高中同学
I went to high school with Mitch.

24
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,660
我们一起参加过戏剧社
We were in the drama club together.

25
00:01:10,723 --> 00:01:12,305
-想起来了 -是的
- That's right. - Yeah.

26
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:13,700
老天 你卸了老头子妆
Geez, I didn't recognize you

27
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,200
我都认不出你了
without that old-guy makeup on.

28
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:17,840
你和米奇演的《阳光小子》火爆全场
You know, you and Mitch knocked The Sunshine Boys out of the park.

29
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:19,520
米奇演得很棒
Mitch was really great in that.

30
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:20,960
我一直觉得他是当演员的料
I always thought he should be an actor.

31
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,200
他现在找了份真正的工作
Yeah, he's got a real job now.

32
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,800
他做了律师 你呢
He's a lawyer. How about you?

33
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:26,140
-我还在演戏 -那敢情好
- Still acting. - Fantastic.

34
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:28,220
其实挺过瘾的 我演了部新电影
Actually, it's exciting. I'm in a new movie,

35
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,620
《枫叶大道》 刚上映的
Maple Drive. Just came out.

36
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:32,580
真的吗 哇 我认识名人了
You're kidding me. Look at me. I know somebody famous.

37
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,676
那我先走了
Uh, anyway, I got to go.

38
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,020
-见到你真高兴 -我也是
- Great to see you. - Good to see you too.

39
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,260
这孩子成电影明星了
Kid's a movie star.

40
00:01:38,436 --> 00:01:41,786
-医生怎么说 -没有蛀牙
- Hey, how'd it go in there? - No cavities.

41
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:43,080
我还得了把免费牙刷
And I got a free toothbrush.

42
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:44,360
嘿 你想去看电影吗
Hey, you want to go to the movies?

43
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:45,900
我刚听说一部好片子
I just heard about a good one.

44
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,460
可我该去上学了
But I'm supposed to be in school.

45
00:01:47,534 --> 00:01:48,676
你还应该用牙线呢
Well, you're supposed to floss too,

46
00:01:48,676 --> 00:01:49,978
你不也躲过了吗
but you got away with that one.

47
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,120
来 走吧
Come on. Let's go.

48
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,900
我生命中最美好的几个日子之一
One of the greatest days of my life...

49
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:55,820
就是我老爹带我逃课
was when my old man sprung me from school

50
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:56,940
然后带我去坐卡车
and took me to the track.

51
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,860
我想让曼尼有同样的体验
I wanted to do the same type of thing for Manny,

52
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:02,120
再说如果歌洛莉亚听到这事
plus I figured when Gloria heard about it,

53
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,420
也许会在卧室好好犒赏我
maybe it pays off in the bedroom.

54
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:08,320
我老爹当年莫非也是为了这个
I wonder if that's why my old man did it.

55
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,440
靠 毁了
Oh, crap.

56
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:13,060
你婆婆非要养这只狗
Your mother-in-law just had to have the dog.

57
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:14,760
结果发现原来她对狗过敏
Turns out she's allergic.

58
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:17,280
宠物店就没个宽限期
And the pet store didn't have a grace period

59
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,180
或者包退换之类的吗
or a return policy or anything?

60
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:20,660
它是从宠物收留所领回来的
I got him from the pound.

61
00:02:20,820 --> 00:02:22,736
堪萨斯州刮龙卷风了吧
Was there a twister in Kansas?

62
00:02:22,736 --> 00:02:25,280
不然怎么把房子刮到我家车道上了
'Cause there's a house in my driveway.

63
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,248
欢迎回家 邓菲先生
Welcome home, Mr. Dunphy.

64
00:02:27,248 --> 00:02:29,766
很高兴见到你 邓菲先生
Uh, always a pleasure, Mr. Dunphy.

65
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:33,020
我也是 邓菲先生 请把它放在那里
Indeed it is, Mr. Dunphy. Place it there.

66
00:02:33,087 --> 00:02:36,582
-好的好的 -真怀念啊 来抱一个
- Oh, I shall. I shall. - I miss this. Get in here.

67
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:37,580
我爸超级棒
My dad is awesome.

68
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:40,660
他特别好 永远积极向上 笑口常开
He's awesome. He's always up. He's always happy.

69
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:42,460
他跟我是好哥们
I mean, he and I are best buds.

70
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,100
我们就像一个模子刻出来的
We're like two peas in a pod.

71
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:46,960
或者是连体双胞胎 或者双头蛇
Or Siamese twins. Or a snake with two heads.

72
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:50,260
-他们在万圣节扮过以上所有角色 -没错
- They've actually been all those things for Halloween. - Yeah.

73
00:02:51,219 --> 00:02:52,900
哎哟 这一定是斯科特吧
Oy. This must be Scout, huh?

74
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:54,540
我得警告你 他会脱毛
I should warn you. He sheds.

75
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,820
我一路上让他上床和我一起睡
I made the mistake of letting him sleep with me on the road.

76
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:59,518
我那床单就跟被俩野人滚过一样
Now my sheets look like two bigfoots did it.

77
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,860
原谅我的粗俗用语
Pardon the language.

78
00:03:01,652 --> 00:03:04,031
-我妈好吗 -说到那个"大脚野人"
- How's Mom? - Speaking of big feet, eh?

79
00:03:04,101 --> 00:03:06,340
她和她的闺蜜们乘游轮旅游去了
She's on a cruise with her girlfriends,

80
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,480
大多都是恐龙 也有几个尚有几分姿色
some of which are not totally unattractive.

81
00:03:08,900 --> 00:03:11,220
那倒提醒了我 她给孩子们带了礼物
Oh, that reminds me. She sent some gifts for the kids.

82
00:03:11,296 --> 00:03:13,744
我马上就回来
Um, I will be right back.

83
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:16,240
-你们仨先套套近乎 -没问题
- You three get better acquainted. - Will do!

84
00:03:16,373 --> 00:03:18,209
-慢走 -没问题
- Bye! - Will do!

85
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:21,060
真不敢相信你没和我商量就领来了只狗
I cannot believe you got a dog without consulting me.

86
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:22,760
此事需要全家共同商议才行
This was a major family decision.

87
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:24,480
-我错了 -知道就好
- It was wrong. - Yeah.

88
00:03:24,615 --> 00:03:25,510
对不起
And I'm sorry.

89
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:28,260
可我们早就讨论过养狗的事了
But we have talked about getting a dog for years,

90
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,980
全家只有你不同意
and you're the only one who wasn't into it.

91
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,640
因为我知道照顾它都会是我的活儿
Because I knew that I would be the one taking care of it.

92
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,340
不会的
That's not true.

93
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:35,520
我们都会帮忙的
No, we will all help.

94
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:39,500
这也是教导孩子责任感的大好机会
This is a great chance to teach the kids responsibility.

95
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:42,520
当年你让卢克送报纸时也是这么说的
That is exactly what you said about Luke's paper route.

96
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,520
有人吗
Hello?

97
00:04:05,460 --> 00:04:07,200
里面有人吗
Is anyone in there?

98
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,240
你真适合红色
Red's a good color on you.

99
00:04:26,580 --> 00:04:27,800
只是电影罢了
It's just a movie.

100
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,940
-它好可爱啊 -瞧它那小脸
- Oh, he's so cute. - Look at his little face.

101
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,880
我一直想养狗来着 谢谢爷爷
I always wanted a dog. Thanks, Grandpa.

102
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:37,720
你们要记得 养狗可是个大责任
Okay, but remember, having a dog is a major responsibility.

103
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:39,980
家里每个人都得负责任
Everyone in the family has to pitch in.

104
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:42,840
-没问题 邓太太 -没包括你 迪兰
- Can do, Mrs. D. - Not you, Dylan.

105
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,180
松了一口气 我最近正好忙着呢
Oh, phew. 'Cause I got a lot on my plate right now.

106
00:04:45,237 --> 00:04:47,403
看看谁来了 小卡舅夫
Hey, look who's here. Uncle Cam.

107
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:49,320
嘿 我们听说来了新成员
Hey, we heard about the new addition

108
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,860
所以一定得来看看
and we had to come right over.

109
00:04:50,930 --> 00:04:53,840
卡梅隆 又见到你了
Cameron, so good to see you again.

110
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,400
这衬衣真好看
Now that is a shirt.

111
00:04:55,462 --> 00:04:57,140
谢了 弗兰克 我网购的
Oh, well, thank you, Frank. I get 'em online.

112
00:04:57,140 --> 00:04:58,080
回头发给你链接
I'll send you a link.

113
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,900
好吧 我自家熏制了香肠
Oh, well, at home, I smoke sausages.

114
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,020
回头也给你发一节
I'll send you a link.

115
00:05:02,100 --> 00:05:02,520
真经典
Classic.

116
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:05,560
-这就是莉莉吧 -是的
- And this must be Lily. - Oh, yes.

117
00:05:05,673 --> 00:05:07,732
她等不及要来看新狗狗了
She just couldn't wait to meet the new doggy.

118
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,760
我看她待在这里挺好
I think she's good right here.

119
00:05:08,820 --> 00:05:10,640
快让我来和狗狗亲热亲热
Let me get in there and get some of that doggyness.

120
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,280
-宝贝儿啊 -海莉
- Oh, there it is. - Haley.

121
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,160
-乖乖啊 -我得走了
- There it is. - I gotta go.

122
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:18,640
-怎么了 -是布莱恩 他要退出乐队
- What's wrong? - That was Brian. He just quit the band.

123
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:19,800
什么 为什么啊
What? Why?

124
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:21,240
他要搬去波特兰了
He's moving to Portland.

125
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,940
他父母复合了
His parents got back together.

126
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,960
-真可恶 -我知道
- Oh, that sucks. - I know.

127
00:05:25,300 --> 00:05:27,200
我们明天的演出得取消了
Now we're gonna have to cancel the gig tomorrow.

128
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,000
搞不好你能找到其他的鼓手呢
Maybe you can find another drummer.

129
00:05:29,460 --> 00:05:31,200
不 我想现在已经来不及找了
No. I think it's too late for that now.

130
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,980
我会打鼓
I play drums.

131
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:37,340
虽然自从有了莉莉以后 我许久没练了
Well, I mean, I haven't played in a while, since Lily's come along,

132
00:05:37,340 --> 00:05:40,920
不过如果你紧缺人手 我就是你的人手
but if you're in a jam, I can jam.

133
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:43,240
我很高兴 可我不确定
Well, I totally would, but I'm not sure

134
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,120
我们玩的是同一卦的音乐
we like the same sorts of music, you know?

135
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,120
干嘛 我是基佬
What, because I'm gay,

136
00:05:46,140 --> 00:05:47,300
就只会演奏舞台剧的音乐吗
I'm just gonna want to play show tunes?

137
00:05:47,620 --> 00:05:49,440
不 因为你年纪比较大
No, because you're old.

138
00:05:50,788 --> 00:05:53,032
你这话更伤人 迪兰
Wow. That hurt more, Dylan.

139
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:55,020
让他试试吧 总比取消好
Give him a chance. It's better than canceling.

140
00:05:55,540 --> 00:05:56,980
你说得对 我不想白白浪费
You're right. I don't want to lose

141
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:58,500
造雾机的押金
the deposit on that fog machine.

142
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:01,880
好吧 我们试一试
Okay. Let's do it.

143
00:06:02,180 --> 00:06:03,200
我以前是音乐老师
I used to be a music teacher,

144
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:05,300
但有了莉莉后我就放弃了事业
but I gave that up as soon as Lily came along.

145
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:07,160
是的 我们觉得必须有一人
Yes. Well, we just felt that it was really important...

146
00:06:07,219 --> 00:06:08,804
留在家里照顾她 所以
that one of us stayed hometo raise her, so-

147
00:06:08,804 --> 00:06:11,202
不是说别人的选择不好
Yeah, and that's not a judgmenton other people's choices.

148
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:14,140
只是我们的家庭观念非常传统而已
It's just that we happen to be a very traditional family.

149
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:17,740
是的 那个帮莉莉房间祈福的
Yes, that's what the disabled lesbian shaman

150
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:19,400
残疾拉拉神婆也这么说
who blessed Lily's room said too.

151
00:06:25,287 --> 00:06:26,142
你还好吗 孩子
How you doin', buddy?

152
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:28,320
放轻松
All right, relax.

153
00:06:44,793 --> 00:06:46,478
天啊
Oh, geez.

154
00:06:51,743 --> 00:06:54,631
我跟你说 菲尔 你爸真哭了
I am telling you, Phil, the man was crying.

155
00:06:54,700 --> 00:06:55,880
不可能
That is impossible.

156
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,600
我爹是全世界最乐天的人
My dad is the happiest guy on earth.

157
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,240
大概是听起来像哭吧
It probably just sounded like he was crying.

158
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:01,020
你听过他从椅子上起身的声响吗
Have you heard the noise he makes when he gets out of a chair?

159
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,760
不 我听得清清楚楚
No. I know what I heard.

160
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,640
我想大概是和你妈有关
I think this has something to do with your mom.

161
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:07,780
-什么 -想想看 他是一个人来的
- What? - Yeah, he came here alone. Think about it.

162
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,700
她坐游轮玩去了
She's on a cruise.

163
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:11,700
他们从没分开旅行过 所以
Yeah, and they never take separate vacations, so-

164
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:14,760
不 不可能 如果真有事
No. No, if something was wrong,

165
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:15,800
我爸会告诉我的
my dad would tell me about it.

166
00:07:15,820 --> 00:07:16,920
不 菲尔 他不会说的
No, Phil, he wouldn't,

167
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:19,040
因为你们从来就没认真聊过
because you guys never actually talk about anything.

168
00:07:19,060 --> 00:07:20,160
我们常聊呢
We talk all the time.

169
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:22,120
我上班时他一周打三次骚扰电话来
He crank calls me at work, like, three times a week.

170
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,800
-骚扰电话不算数 -但是算有趣
- Crank calls don't count. - Counts for fun.

171
00:07:23,883 --> 00:07:26,440
说真的 我想你应该
No, honestly, I think that you should

172
00:07:26,440 --> 00:07:27,660
搞清楚你爸到底怎么了
find out what's going on with your dad.

173
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:29,760
我爸什么事都没有
It's going to be nothing.

174
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,800
他又不像你爸
My dad isn't like your dad.

175
00:07:32,180 --> 00:07:33,860
他没那些城府 心机之类的
There's nothing deep and dark inside.

176
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:37,120
他甜美外表下隐藏的是更多的甜美
His hard candy shell is just hiding more candy.

177
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:41,780
他应该是想出去 好孩子
I think he wants to go out. Good boy.

178
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,840
-聪明的狗狗 -不想扫你的兴
- Smart dog. - I hate to break it to you,

179
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,040
不过这招所有狗都会吧
but I think all dogs can do that.

180
00:07:46,117 --> 00:07:47,783
我要出去玩
I'm gonna play outside.

181
00:07:52,340 --> 00:07:53,220
怎么回事啊
What happened?

182
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,080
好
Okay.

183
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:57,660
我是不是先露一小手
Should I just play a little something?

184
00:07:58,140 --> 00:08:00,580
好啊 不过如果打不好
Yeah. But, you know, if it doesn't work out,

185
00:08:00,580 --> 00:08:01,340
你也别难过
don't feel bad.

186
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:04,980
但愿打鼓就像骑自行车一样
Well, hopefully this is- this is like riding a bicycle,

187
00:08:05,060 --> 00:08:08,313
学了就永远忘不掉
and it'll all come back to me.

188
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:09,600
这是重音鼓
That's the loud one.

189
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,520
好吧 开始了
So... here we go.

190
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:32,720
哎呀 我真傻
Oh, silly me.

191
00:08:33,020 --> 00:08:35,260
我把鼓槌给拿反了
I had the sticks in the wrong hands.

192
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:57,740
老兄 你该给鼓槌贴好左右标签
Dude, you should label those sticks.

193
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:06,820
这是警报吗 我们家被入侵了吗
Is that the alarm? Has our perimeter been breached?

194
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:09,460
不是警报 是门铃停不下来了
It's not the alarm. The doorbell won't stop ringing.

195
00:09:09,780 --> 00:09:11,880
-也许是魔鬼在按门铃 -才没有魔鬼
- Maybe a demon is ringing it. - Not a demon.

196
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,680
谁老是在按门铃啊
Who keeps ringing the doorbell?

197
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,980
-肯定是魔鬼在按 -是吗
- We're pretty sure it's a demon. - Oh, yeah?

198
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:18,740
现在呢
There.

199
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:21,480
如果是魔鬼 它就会继续响了
If it were a demon, it would keep on ringing.

200
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:24,580
除非他已经进屋了 我要去武装起来
Not if he's already inside. I'm getting a weapon.

201
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:26,760
你脑子里想什么呢
What were you thinking?

202
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:29,060
带这么小的孩子去看恐怖片
Who takes a little boy to a horror movie?

203
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,100
你疯了吗 杰
That's loco, Jay.

204
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:32,240
有什么大不了的 你知道什么才恐怖吗
This is no big deal. You want scary?

205
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:33,600
我像他这么大时
When I was his age,

206
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,300
可是经历过古巴导弹危机的
I lived through the Cuban Missile Crisis.

207
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,760
我睡觉时都藏把黄油刀在枕头下
I slept with a butter knife under my pillow...

208
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:40,040
以防要和苏联上校搏斗
in case I had to fight some Soviet colonel.

209
00:09:40,500 --> 00:09:43,740
苏联上校抓你个小屁孩干什么
Why would they send a Soviet colonel to get a little boy?

210
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,780
因为我能认出苏共的每一架飞机
Because I could identify every commie plane.

211
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:47,880
我们这是在说什么呢
What are we talking about?

212
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:50,540
我的意思是 恐惧也是成长的一部分
Look, all I'm saying, being scared is part of growing up.

213
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,360
曼尼会没事的 那有助于培养个性
Manny will get over this. It builds character.

214
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,620
我站第一班岗
I'll take the first watch.

215
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:58,600
你们俩最好先去睡一下
You two might as well get some rest.

216
00:09:59,113 --> 00:10:00,976
长夜漫漫啊
It's gonna be a long night.

217
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:04,620
有个性吧
Character.

218
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:07,320
爸
Dad?

219
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,480
进来吧 门没锁
Come on in! It's open!

220
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:13,060
别说你是上隔壁借白糖来了
Don't tell me. You need a cup of sugar.

221
00:10:13,406 --> 00:10:15,309
不 我只是
Nah. Just, uh-

222
00:10:16,184 --> 00:10:18,481
我只是觉得 那个
I was just wondering, I don't know, uh-

223
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,280
您脑子里没在烦恼什么事吧
Anything on the old noodle?

224
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:22,980
除了这顶烂假发吗
Other than a bad toupee?

225
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:25,600
我开玩笑的 这可是真头发
I'm kidding, of course. This is my real hair.

226
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,680
-好吧 -等一下
- Well, okay. - Wait a minute.

227
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,460
我有事问你
I want to ask you something.

228
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:32,360
我把狗带来是不是让你为难了
Am I putting you in a bad position with this whole dog thing?

229
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:34,500
克莱尔看起来不太高兴
Claire seemed a little put out.

230
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:37,060
别理她 克莱尔一开始还不喜欢我呢
Oh, don't worry about it. Claire didn't like me at first either.

231
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:40,300
那也不怪她 解散
I can't blame her. Dismissed!

232
00:10:41,101 --> 00:10:45,448
爸 你知道吗 我...
Oh, Dad, um, you know what? I, uh-

233
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,620
克莱尔撞见了一件事
Claire saw something,

234
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:49,080
要是我不问你 她非灭了我
and she'd kill me if I- if I didn't ask.

235
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,860
什么事
What is it?

236
00:10:54,420 --> 00:10:57,120
你吃早饭时就不能穿条裤子吗 真叫人"哭"笑不得
Would you wear pants to breakfast, for crying out loud?

237
00:10:57,265 --> 00:11:01,473
-又被你骗到了 正中弱点 -很好
- You got me again. Right in the funny bone. - All right.

238
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,440
拜托 斯科特 松口
Come on, Scout. Let go of it.

239
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,640
别 别
No, no, no!

240
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,500
坏狗狗 你看这个
Dog. Look at this.

241
00:11:07,567 --> 00:11:10,127
他怎么会有你的胸罩
How did he get ahold of your bra?

242
00:11:10,195 --> 00:11:11,980
我们出去约会
Well, uh, we were out on a date,

243
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:13,580
他有辆特别好的车 于是
and he has a really nice car, so-

244
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:15,860
你以为呢 当然是从洗衣篮里找到的
How do you think? He got it out of the laundry basket.

245
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:18,380
对这狗一秒钟也不能大意
Can't take my eyes off that dog for a second.

246
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:19,700
干嘛不把它关笼子里
Why don't you just keep him in the crate?

247
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:22,420
我关了 他自己会开笼子
I tried that. He figured out how to get out.

248
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:23,840
你不是去找你爸谈话了吗
I thought you were dealing with your dad.

249
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:26,040
没错 我们谈了 他没事
Oh, yeah, I did. He's fine, so-

250
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:28,280
你们才谈两分钟就谈好了吗
You got that from a two-minute conversation?

251
00:11:30,260 --> 00:11:32,740
我直接问他还好吗
I... asked him point-blank if he was okay.

252
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,500
他说很好 所以我就
He said he was. So I just-

253
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:37,260
结果你们扯了几个笑话 就谈完了
Just swapped some jokes and moved on.

254
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:40,800
菲尔 你得更深入地问他
Phil, the man needs more of a push than that.

255
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:43,620
如果他想谈 他会主动说的
Look, if he wants to talk to me about it, he will.

256
00:11:44,780 --> 00:11:46,280
有人的内裤搅成一团了
Geez, someone's panties are in a bunch.

257
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:49,080
-我只想表示一下关心 -不 你看
- I thought I was showing concern and- - No. Right there.

258
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:51,560
我的天 这该死的狗
Oh, my God! That damn dog!

259
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:53,940
二位 帮帮忙啊
Guys, little help?

260
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:58,980
我要上厕所了 我可不想尿裤子
I have to go to the bathroom, and I'm not gonna do it in here.

261
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:10,580
-我买了中餐外卖 -太好了 正饿着呢
- Hey, I got Chinese. - Sweet! I'm starving.

262
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,274
有客人呀
Oh, we have guests.

263
00:12:12,274 --> 00:12:15,740
我们正合奏呢
Yeah. We're just having a little jam session.

264
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,940
迪兰你认识的 那边是克雷格和尼尔
You know Dylan. This is Craig. This is Neil.

265
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:21,040
我会记得他是抱着我女儿的陌生人
I'll always remember him as the stranger holding my baby.

266
00:12:21,140 --> 00:12:22,480
你能到厨房来一下吗
Can I talk to you in the kitchen for a second?

267
00:12:23,035 --> 00:12:26,091
好的 各位 我们休息一下
Yeah. Hey, guys, let's, uh- let's just take five.

268
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,520
这支龙虎少年队怎么了
What's up with 21 Jump Street?

269
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:30,820
他们的鼓手退团了
Oh, well, their drummer quit

270
00:12:30,820 --> 00:12:32,440
我明晚帮他们顶替一下
and I'm gonna fill in for him tomorrow night.

271
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,739
不 明天我们得去胡娇家的
No, no. We have Pepper's

272
00:12:33,739 --> 00:12:35,580
滑雪风情奶酪火锅派对 小卡
apres-ski fondue party tomorrow night, Cam.

273
00:12:35,580 --> 00:12:36,720
不是吧
Oh, no.

274
00:12:37,151 --> 00:12:38,740
你得通知乐队
So you'll just have to tell your band

275
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:39,860
另请高明了
that they're gonna have to find someone else.

276
00:12:40,180 --> 00:12:42,380
不 我不能失信于他们
You know what? No. I'm not gonna let these fellas down.

277
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,160
我答应他们了
I made a commitment.

278
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,380
你也答应了胡娇 好吗
You made two commitments, okay?

279
00:12:45,380 --> 00:12:46,580
而你又知道胡娇那脾气
And you know how Pepper is.

280
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:47,720
凡事必须完美
Everything has to be perfect.

281
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,480
你不穿厚毛衣他都能跟你急
He gets mad if you don't wear a big sweater.

282
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,480
我记得 去年我热得要命
Yeah, I remember. I got so hot last year,

283
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,000
差点晕死在奶酪上
I almost went face down in the gruyere.

284
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:55,200
所以你是想让我一个人去吗
So I'm going by myself, is that what you're saying?

285
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:58,080
我真心需要参加这个
I just feel like I kind of need this.

286
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:00,340
为了丰富你大学申请书吗
To round out your college applications?

287
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:03,620
我总是呆在家里守着莉莉
It's just that because I'm always home with Lily...

288
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:05,900
我闷得有点发疯了
I just feel like I'm going a little bit stir-crazy.

289
00:13:05,900 --> 00:13:06,700
你看看那书房
Look at the den.

290
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:08,960
被我翻来覆去地粉刷
Every time I finish painting it, I start all over again.

291
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,240
都快赶上金门大桥了
It's like the Golden Gate Bridge.

292
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,360
我要回去练习了
I'm gonna go back to jamming.

293
00:13:21,540 --> 00:13:23,840
得 我们必须解决这事了
Yeah, we gotta fix this.

294
00:13:34,103 --> 00:13:35,900
穿厚毛衣来听演唱会
Hey, what's with the big sweater at a concert?

295
00:13:35,900 --> 00:13:36,719
是基友们的穿衣风格吗
Is that a gay thing?

296
00:13:36,719 --> 00:13:40,359
不 是为了胡娇的滑雪风格风奶酪火锅
No, Dad. It's for my friend Pepper's apres-ski fondue-

297
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:41,680
好吧 的确是基友们的风格
Yeah. Yeah, it's a gay thing.

298
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:43,880
最好赶紧开始
Hope they start soon.

299
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:45,500
斯科特不喜欢独守空屋
I don't think Scout likes to be left alone.

300
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,660
你挺喜欢那狗的嘛
You love the dog.

301
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,960
不 不是喜欢它 我是心疼我的沙发
No, I don't love the dog. I love my couch.

302
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:54,520
那狗看沙发的眼神就跟那是巨型香肠一样
And the dog was looking at it like it was a giant sausage.

303
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,260
孩子们 好消息 你的车道要腾空了
Good news, you two. You're getting your driveway back.

304
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:59,960
-明天一早我就上路 -这么快
- I'm hitting the open road in the morning. - Oh, already?

305
00:14:00,053 --> 00:14:01,824
-没错 -迫不急待想回家看妈了吧
- Yeah. - Anxious to get home and see Mom, huh?

306
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:04,060
不 我打算要随风游荡一下
No, I'm just gonna drive wherever the wind blows me,

307
00:14:04,060 --> 00:14:05,600
一般也就是飘到隔壁的车道
which is usually into the next lane.

308
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,080
我们去喝苏打汽水好吗 爷爷
Can we get some sodas, Grandpa?

309
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:09,660
好呀 不过只能一杯 我还得开车
Okay, but just one. I'm driving. Come on.

310
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:14,520
他居然不回家 他从没离开我妈
He's not going home? He's never been away from my mom

311
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:16,080
超过看医生的时间
for longer than a doctor's appointment.

312
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:18,080
亲爱的 我知道 我就说嘛
Honey, I know. I told you.

313
00:14:18,140 --> 00:14:19,380
我一直很同情那些
I always felt bad for people

314
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:20,740
和父亲关系疏远的人
with emotionally distant fathers.

315
00:14:20,798 --> 00:14:22,242
结果我也是其中之一
It turns out I'm one of 'em.

316
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:24,840
我没沦落成脱衣舞男真是奇迹
It's a miracle I didn't end up a stripper.

317
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,340
谢谢各位来观看演出
Thanks, everybody, for coming out.

318
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,280
下面是我们写的几首歌
These are some songs we wrote.

319
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:32,700
一二 一二三
One, two. One, two, three.

320
00:14:33,386 --> 00:14:36,673
*宝贝别走 我只想让你知道*
* Baby, don't leave me I just want you to know *

321
00:14:36,673 --> 00:14:38,693
*我只想让你知道*
* I want you to know *

322
00:14:39,322 --> 00:14:43,037
*有些热情我自己也控制不了*
* There's something inside me that I cannot control *

323
00:14:43,095 --> 00:14:44,905
*我控制不了*
* I cannot control *

324
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:48,920
-我俩的男朋友都帅呆了 -没错
- Our boyfriends totally rock! - I know, right?

325
00:14:48,974 --> 00:14:50,494
*听到你高喊我的名字 我就彻底疯狂*
* I heard you screamin' my name I'm goin' insane *

326
00:14:50,540 --> 00:14:52,360
我原计划
Well, the plan was...

327
00:14:52,416 --> 00:14:53,540
看十分钟的演出
to watch him for 10 minutes

328
00:14:53,540 --> 00:14:54,920
就溜去胡娇的派对
and then run out to Pepper's party.

329
00:14:54,999 --> 00:14:58,113
*奔腾在我的血管中*
* Coursing through my veins *

330
00:14:58,180 --> 00:15:01,600
可他在台上太亮眼了
But he was so great up there.

331
00:15:01,649 --> 00:15:02,951
我怎么舍得离开
How-How could I leave?

332
00:15:03,007 --> 00:15:06,586
*别害怕*
* But don't be afraid *

333
00:15:06,635 --> 00:15:08,351
*我就是你的吸血鬼*
* I'll be your vampire *

334
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:11,280
那是他的光辉时刻
It was his moment.

335
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:14,200
棒吧
I know!

336
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:32,060
那时刻持续了很久很久的时间
And his moment went on for a really, really long time.

337
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,420
久到我可以溜去参加派对
Turns out I could have run to the party

338
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:54,260
再回来听他的最后一敲
and made it back for the end of his moment.

339
00:15:58,340 --> 00:16:00,440
曼尼 去刷牙准备上床睡觉
Manny, go brush your teeth and get ready for bed, okay?

340
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:03,420
-上你的床 -我能看电视吗
- Your bed. - Can I watch TV?

341
00:16:03,487 --> 00:16:06,299
-只能看十分钟哦 -好
- Mmm, only 10 minutes. - Okay.

342
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,580
你好 杰 我是本·杜根
Hey, Jay, it's Ben Dugan.

343
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:17,820
我收到你的留言了
I got your message.

344
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:20,380
我很乐意帮忙 我晚上来拜访
Uh, yes, I'm happy to help out. I'll swing by tonight.

345
00:16:20,740 --> 00:16:22,243
-谁啊 -是本
- What's that? - That's Ben.

346
00:16:22,243 --> 00:16:23,195
演电影的那个
That's the guy who was in the movie.

347
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:26,740
我想如果曼尼看到他真人很善良
I figure when Manny sees him, sees how nice he is,

348
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,380
他会发现电影都是假的
he'll realize it's all pretend.

349
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:36,060
-你觉得会有效吗 -那家伙人可好了
- You think that will work? - Guy's a sweetheart.

350
00:16:36,540 --> 00:16:38,180
曼尼和他聊一聊
Manny's gonna spend two minutes with him.

351
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,520
听他解释电影拍摄过程
He'll explain how the movie's made.

352
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:41,880
他还带了他的道具刀来
He's even bringing his fake machete.

353
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,080
橡胶做的
Thing's made of rubber.

354
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:53,220
你是曼尼吧 我是来找你的
Hey, are you Manny? I'm here for you.

355
00:16:54,225 --> 00:16:55,446
瞧我带了什么
Look what I got.

356
00:16:58,460 --> 00:17:00,860
妈 他来了
Mom, he's here!

357
00:17:00,926 --> 00:17:02,597
怎么啦 怎么啦
Que paso? Que paso? Que paso?

358
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:08,380
我们得换张大床了
We're gonna need a bigger bed!

359
00:17:10,180 --> 00:17:12,481
靠
Oh, geez.

360
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,860
天啊 真的是他
Oh, my God! I think that's him.

361
00:17:17,771 --> 00:17:19,474
-你没溜走啊 -没有
- You stayed. - Yeah.

362
00:17:19,530 --> 00:17:21,316
我可是乐队家属
Well, you know, I'm-I'm with the band.

363
00:17:21,380 --> 00:17:24,480
我觉得演出某些地方还需改进
I thought the gig was a little sloppy in spots,

364
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:26,440
不过等我学会了所有的歌
but I think once I learn all the songs-

365
00:17:27,607 --> 00:17:30,005
我以为你只参加这一次呢
I thought- I thought this was a one-time thing?

366
00:17:30,005 --> 00:17:32,497
你开玩笑吧 我们秒杀了全场
Are you kidding? We destroyed in there.

367
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:34,440
你没听到有个妹子大喊我的名字吗
Did you hear that one lady screaming my name?

368
00:17:34,800 --> 00:17:37,060
那是菲尔喊的 他喝了罐红牛
That was Phil. He had a Red Bull.

369
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:39,960
各位 表现得不错吧
Hey, guys. Good gig, huh?

370
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:42,580
-是啊 棒极了 -震撼的演出
- Yeah. Totally awesome, man. - Heck of a gig.

371
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,536
大伙儿好啊
Hey, guys.

372
00:17:43,536 --> 00:17:46,605
嘿 你不是去波特兰了吗
Hey. I thought you were in Portland.

373
00:17:46,605 --> 00:17:49,160
没 我爸妈又闹崩了
No. My parents broke up again.

374
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:51,480
我不搬走了 我可以继续参加乐队了
I'm not moving. I can stay in the band.

375
00:17:53,331 --> 00:17:55,931
这下可尴尬了
Well, this is awkward.

376
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:58,800
小卡
Cam.

377
00:18:01,447 --> 00:18:03,338
原来是我尴尬了
Oh, awkward for me.

378
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:09,740
加油赶超我吧 林戈
Good luck following that, Ringo.

379
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:15,060
这是你们的电线
I believe this belongs to you.

380
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:17,520
我也不想拖着一房子在后面跑
I don't want to drag the house along with me.

381
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:19,160
小猴子们 都过来
Come here, you little monkeys.

382
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:21,220
再见 爷爷 我们会想你的
Bye, Grandpa. We'll miss you.

383
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,840
真希望能把你们一起带走
I wish I could take you with me.

384
00:18:22,932 --> 00:18:25,164
-路上小心 爷爷 -我尽量
- Drive safe, Grandpa. - Oh, I'll try.

385
00:18:25,220 --> 00:18:26,360
你真的不留下吃早餐吗
You sure you don't want to stay for breakfast?

386
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:30,420
不 我该上路了
No, I ought to be hitting the road.

387
00:18:31,423 --> 00:18:32,944
再会了
Well, adios.

388
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:33,800
爸 等一下
Dad, hold on.

389
00:18:33,879 --> 00:18:36,092
-我能和你谈谈吗 -好呀
- Can I talk to you for a second? - Sure.

390
00:18:37,256 --> 00:18:39,230
宝贝们 我们走吧
Guys. Come on.

391
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:43,101
我觉得你没跟我说实话
I don't think you're being honest with me.

392
00:18:43,101 --> 00:18:46,498
我知道你有什么事在心上
I- I know something is going on with you.

393
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:49,080
到底是什么事
What's up?

394
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:53,580
心上 我的内裤倒是提得太上面了
Something up? Well, my boxers are, uh, riding a little high.

395
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:55,340
我没在没心气跟你开玩笑
I'm not in the mood for jokes right now,

396
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:56,860
-虽然刚才那句逗死了 -谢谢
- although you nailed that. - Thanks.

397
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,020
-说得真好 -谢了
- Great stuff. - Thanks.

398
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:03,300
-我没事 -没事吗
- It's nothing. - Oh, it's nothing?

399
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:07,060
-不是跟妈有关吧 -不是
- Nothing to do with Mom? - No!

400
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:13,520
好吧 其实有关 我坠入爱河了
Well, yeah. I've fallen in love.

401
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,240
我的天
Oh, my God.

402
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:17,460
-她是谁 -是他
- Who is she? - He!

403
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:19,680
什么
What?

404
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:22,640
就是那边的小家伙啊
It's that little guy right over there.

405
00:19:22,940 --> 00:19:25,057
快过来 过来 过来
Come on over here. Come on. Come on.

406
00:19:25,057 --> 00:19:27,680
好孩子 瞧瞧他
There you go. Ah, look at him.

407
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:28,960
在驾车穿越全国的路上
Driving across country,

408
00:19:29,029 --> 00:19:30,751
这个小崽子成功地
this little bastard nuzzled his way

409
00:19:30,751 --> 00:19:33,460
夺走了我的心 对不对
right into my heart, didn't ya?

410
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:36,060
所以你就是不想送掉这狗罢了
So this is just about you not wanting to leave the dog?

411
00:19:36,080 --> 00:19:37,120
你该和妈说清楚
Well, you should tell Mom.

412
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:39,360
和它在路上的这三天
Those three days on the road with him

413
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:40,500
是我人生最快乐的日子
were the happiest of my life.

414
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:41,840
这话你就别对她说了
You should leave that part out.

415
00:19:42,060 --> 00:19:45,060
我不想因为留下斯科特而让爷爷难过
I don't want to keep Scout if it makes Grandpa sad.

416
00:19:45,060 --> 00:19:48,240
我知道 宝贝 可是奶奶会过敏
Yeah, I know, sweetie. But Grandma has allergies,

417
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:50,140
所以斯科特必须留下
so Scout has to stay with us.

418
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:53,040
她可以打抗过敏针嘛
Well, she could always just get some allergy shots.

419
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:55,060
亲爱的 你不会愿意让她遭那罪的
Honey, you don't want to put her through that.

420
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:57,880
靠 当年我还为她做了结扎手术呢
Hell, back in the day, I got a vasectomy for her.

421
00:19:58,120 --> 00:20:00,380
爸 爸 真的
Dad. Dad. Please.

422
00:20:00,380 --> 00:20:02,930
斯科特是你的狗
Scout's- Scout's your dog.

423
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,140
他应该跟着你走
He should go with you.

424
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:10,480
那好吧 这可是你逼我的
Okay, you twisted my arm.

425
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:15,100
谢了 儿子 多谢你看穿了我的伪装
Thanks, Son. Thanks for poking through the armor.

426
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:17,420
-您下面也快穿出来了 -什么
- You're poking through the armor down there. - What?

427
00:20:17,580 --> 00:20:18,160
骗到你了
Made you look.

428
00:20:19,140 --> 00:20:20,520
你真是块奇才
You are a treasure.

429
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:22,600
来吧 斯科特 我们走了
Come on, Scout. Let's mosey.

430
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,820
等一下
Oh, oh, oh! Oh, wait.

431
00:20:28,140 --> 00:20:30,985
-他喜欢这个 -那是肯定的
- He loves that, yeah. - Oh, I bet he does.

432
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:33,240
不 斯科特 这次轮到我开车了
No, Scout. This time I drive.

433
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:34,920
好好笑
You still got it!

434
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,600
真不敢相信我会这么说
I can't believe I'm saying this,

435
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:40,440
不过我好像和我爸更加亲近了
but I think I might have actually gotten even closer with my dad.

436
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:44,640
真不敢相信他把我的狗带走了
I can't believe he took my dog.

437
00:20:44,772 --> 00:20:47,041
-再见 -爷爷再见 爱你哦
- Bye-bye. - Bye, Grandpa! Love you!

438
00:20:47,125 --> 00:20:48,903
再见 老爸
Bye, Dad.

439
00:20:49,022 --> 00:20:52,047
-爷爷再见 我爱你 -卢克 停下
- Bye, Grandpa! I love you! - Luke, stay!

440
00:20:52,179 --> 00:20:54,508
-卢克 停下 -下次再来 再见啦
-Luke, stay! - Come back soon! I'll see you later!

441
00:20:54,580 --> 00:20:55,080
卢克 停下
Luke, stay!

442
00:20:55,140 --> 00:20:56,807
-卢克 -停下
- Luke! - Stay!

443
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:01,520
弗兰克
Frank.

444
00:21:02,560 --> 00:21:04,300
杰 真高兴见到你
Hey, Jay. Good to see you.

445
00:21:04,420 --> 00:21:06,700
我也是 没想到你会在这儿
Great to see you. Didn't expect to find you here.

446
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:09,540
当我孙女男友的乐队
Well, listen, when my granddaughter's boyfriend's band

447
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:12,520
和我儿媳妇弟弟的男友
plays an under-21 club with my daughter-in-law's

448
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:15,120
在少年俱乐部一起演出 我不会错过
brother's gay partner, I show up.

449
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,420
这可是礼节问题
That's just how I was raised.

450
00:21:16,520 --> 00:21:19,309
-你还没见过我太太吧 歌洛莉亚 -你好
- I don't think you met my wife, Gloria. - Hola.

451
00:21:19,369 --> 00:21:22,690
很高兴见到你 你真是漂亮啊
Oh, it's a pleasure. You are a lovely woman.

452
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:25,180
-你一定是弗兰克吧 -哎呀呀
- You must be Frank. - Okay, then,

453
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:29,000
你比国庆节时的拉斯维加斯街头还要火热啊
you are hotter than a Las Vegas sidewalk on the Fourth of July.

454
00:21:29,430 --> 00:21:31,580
-我太过火了吗 -不 没事 弗兰克
- Did I go too far? - Not you, Frank. No.
